\n5, Take disadvantage on all rolls, if the target already has disadvantage, take double disadvantage.\n5, Can not wear armour or clothing or use weapons or any devices\n5, Target ages Xd6 years (X is the ammount of damage dealt to Caster from the killing blow)\n5, Lose d6+1 levels\n5, Drop whatever you are holding whenever you roll less than half to hit\n5, Must always tell the truth\n5, Must never tell the truth\n3, [main], [main]\n2, [main], [main], [main]\n2, [main], [main], [main], [main]\n1, [main], [main], [main], [main], [main]\n1, [main], [main], [main], [main], [main], [main]\n1, [main], [main], [main], [main], [main], [main], [main]","warnings":[]}},"attributionBasis":"earliest-retained-content","originalContributor":{"name":"Tuefish","id":555,"ip":null},"originalSourceFile":"tables/wizard-s-death-curse/subtables/main/history/2017-09-18T17-34-49Z/table.json"}]}
